	(text "VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + (R4 + R302)/(R5 + R303)) = 5.10 V, above VBUS; fsw = 658 kHz (R3 + R301 = 147 k).\nCompensation R6, C7 taken from the passive palette, simulated (sim/README.md).\nUVLO (R1 + R300 = 200 k, R2 + R308 = 16.8 k): start 15.25 V (16.97 V worst case), stop 14.57 V.\n60 V parts throughout: the TVS clamps at 53.3 V."
